    <h2 id="balloon">Balloon / Speech Bubble</h2>
    <p>Tooltip with a speech bubble tail. Use <code>.balloon-bottom</code>, <code>.balloon-right</code>, etc. for positioning. The bare <code>balloon</code> class still works as a legacy alias.</p>

    <%- example(`
      [[<div class="demo-row demo-row--tight demo-pad-top">]]
        <div class="aqua-balloon" style="max-width: 200px;">
          This is a balloon tooltip with the tail pointing up.
        </div>
        <div class="aqua-balloon balloon-bottom" style="max-width: 200px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">
          Tail pointing down.
        </div>
      [[</div>]]
    `) %>

